{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Golf gameplay, inspired by Hot Shots and Tiger Woods games, updated for Disc Golf! A faithful interpretation of the sport powered by Unreal Engine 4 and coffee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heads Up: This is NOT the version of the game that can be played with a TechDisc! Steam doesnt allow apps that require outside subscriptions. That is available on itch.io, search for Perfect Round Disc Golf there, or follow the link from the Tree Branch Games website to find that version.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real disc golf!</strong>  The best physics in a disc flight simulation, combined with DGA Mach 7 baskets and 51 real Discraft/DGA discs creates the most realistic disc golf game to date.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/0a05ec53209f9bbdbf043eecfd28775c.poster.avif?t=1769649053\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/0a05ec53209f9bbdbf043eecfd28775c.webm?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/0a05ec53209f9bbdbf043eecfd28775c.mp4?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play alone, or bring some friends!</strong>  Level up your abilities in a solo round, 8 player online matches, or invite up to 3 friends over to your house for some face to face trash talk! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/281fd4802c87ea6f0d8f61c8fa870727.poster.avif?t=1769649053\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/281fd4802c87ea6f0d8f61c8fa870727.webm?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/281fd4802c87ea6f0d8f61c8fa870727.mp4?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>279 holes to play!</strong>  From a challenging par 2 island course to championship style courses with par 4 and par 5 holes, master each of 16 unique courses and compete for a spot on the global leaderboards! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/48d7e03b6383bce8c1872239a07a88a3.poster.avif?t=1769649053\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/48d7e03b6383bce8c1872239a07a88a3.webm?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/48d7e03b6383bce8c1872239a07a88a3.mp4?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wacky characters!</strong>  Because who wouldn\u2019t want to play disc golf with Sun Wukong, the Monkey King? If that\u2019s not your thing or grandma stops by for a round, you can always turn on nonfiction mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/143d00f113bb502380998f4903b8dad6.poster.avif?t=1769649053\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/143d00f113bb502380998f4903b8dad6.webm?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/143d00f113bb502380998f4903b8dad6.mp4?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion captured animations!</strong>  The most accurate animations for a disc golf game yet, all recorded with a motion capture suit from real throws by myself. Give me some form tips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/a9998f4d4c06b8a04a2836134c2e7440.poster.avif?t=1769649053\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/a9998f4d4c06b8a04a2836134c2e7440.webm?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/extras/a9998f4d4c06b8a04a2836134c2e7440.mp4?t=1769649053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Me</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having been a gamer since playing Civilization 2 on my parent\u2019s Macintosh, when I started disc golfing 8 years ago it didn\u2019t take long before I looked for a game in the style of classic golf games, but with the unique flight and challenges that come with disc golf. When I realized that game didn't exist, the idea of creating it myself stuck with me until I finally downloaded Unreal Engine 4 and started learning the engine to make it. This is the disc golf game I want to play, and I am always taking recommendations from other players who feel the same.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Throw 1 Mile","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/886fc01c74ccac9cb8ab3f5049a2dfba5ee83ba7.jpg"},{"name":"Throw 10 Miles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/f23efa6cc52521c478ec85410e9b1471c3ac0130.jpg"},{"name":"Eagle!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/0208c1eb35b5b38ccae5293063b3f675f9e2580b.jpg"},{"name":"10 Eagles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/5d31b3a03fcab71cd8dd259c1f744e0394012501.jpg"},{"name":"First of many","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/15085a5fa214eb7dfb647cd8d0a9b9ed8acd528b.jpg"},{"name":"Just getting started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/7d8c91cbabc12ac92ad7b088c299408b93dc096d.jpg"},{"name":"Birdie century","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/eef9f22696e570204e5620c119d46a4b7ebeba2d.jpg"},{"name":"ACE!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/5293c5294f223a65cdd8478cb8f20da7a4756b78.jpg"},{"name":"200 ft. throw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/21a0dd60700763264293141bca7a300f97322322.jpg"},{"name":"300 ft. throw","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1029570/2f1b7a84373cc0ce20bfeeb176d41663b2408ec0.jpg"}],"total":24},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1029570?t=1769649053","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769649053","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769649053","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769649053","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"descr