at game didn't exist, the idea of creating it myself stuck with me until I finally downloaded Unreal Engine 4 and started learning the engine to make it. This is the disc golf game I want to play, and I am always taking recommendations from other players who feel the same.</p>","developers":["Tree Branch Games"],"dlc":[2878620],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/header.jpg?t=1769649053","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04.01<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 - 4670 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 770 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 24 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029570/663801/3759570516d94b368603f428a9c5446c18550c6a/1751178659/dash_av1.mpd?t=1708212331","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029570/663801/3759570516d94b368603f428a9c5446c18550c6a/1751178659/dash_h264.mpd?t=1708212331","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029570/663801/3759570516d94b368603f428a9c5446c18550c6a/1751178659/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1708212331","id":257001807,"name":"Perfect Round Disc Golf - Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257001807/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1708212331"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029570/308772/33cd01a7bc76dcfb671ff08339aa9d6167ac2195/1751178657/dash_av1.mpd?t=1708212434","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1029570/308772/33cd01a7bc76dcfb671ff08339aa9d616