49053","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1029570/ss_4e5d082839423952731b3b084f1e740fdc10b9f9.600x338.jpg?t=1769649053"}],"short_description":"A disc golf simulation by the disc golfer, for the disc golfer! Inspired by classic golfing games, updated for our favorite sport. Collect real discs, upgrade skills, and keep hunting the perfect round!","steam_appid":1029570,"support_info":{"email":"treebranchgamesllc@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://treebranchgames.com/"}